  <!-- ============ SECTION 20 ============ -->
  <div class="section-header" id="s20"><span class="num">20</span><h2>Quick-Reference Glossary</h2><span class="line"></span></div>
  <div class="three-col">
    <div class="card cn">
      <div class="glossary-item"><div class="glossary-term">Versicherungstechnische Rückstellungen</div><div class="glossary-def">Technical/actuarial provisions — the umbrella category covering all insurance-specific liability reserves.</div></div>
      <div class="glossary-item"><div class="glossary-term">Deckungsrückstellung</div><div class="glossary-def">The mathematical/actuarial reserve for life insurance obligations — typically the largest liability item on a life insurer's balance sheet.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card cn">
      <div class="glossary-item"><div class="glossary-term">Alterungsrückstellung</div><div class="glossary-def">Ageing reserve — the health-insurance-specific Deckungsrückstellung variant, pre-funding future higher-age healthcare costs.</div></div>
      <div class="glossary-item"><div class="glossary-term">Rückstellung für Beitragsrückerstattung (RfB)</div><div class="glossary-def">Provision for premium refunds, relevant to with-profits/participating policies.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card cn">
      <div class="glossary-item"><div class="glossary-term">Schwankungsrückstellung</div><div class="glossary-def">Equalisation/fluctuation reserve — smoothing reported results for genuinely claims-volatile insurance lines.</div></div>
      <div class="glossary-item"><div class="glossary-term">Anlagestock</div><div class="glossary-def">The dedicated investment pool backing unit-linked life insurance policies, presented distinctly from the insurer's general portfolio.</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="legend">
    <div class="ltitle">Key</div>
